# C64Scene SDK M1.4 - headless double-IRQ smoke/qualification input
#
# This monitor script is intentionally deterministic and non-interactive.
# It verifies that the image reaches the reference code and captures monitor
# state. Cycle-stability PASS is assigned only by a parser with sufficient
# raster/cycle evidence; a successful VICE exit alone is only RUN evidence.

break $080d
command 1 "r; del 1; x"
